WEBVTT


00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club

﻿1

00:01:16.274 --> 00:01:21.274
Subtitles by explosiveskull


00:01:43.510 --> 00:01:46.715
<i>In ancient Russia,
people said,</i>


00:01:46.717 --> 00:01:48.720
<i>do not walk around
the lake at night.</i>


00:01:48.722 --> 00:01:51.926
<i>The mermaid is waiting there,
and as soon as you share</i>


00:01:51.928 --> 00:01:55.734
<i>your feelings of love with
her, she will stun you</i>


00:01:55.736 --> 00:01:59.844
<i>and she will tickle you,
dragging you to the bottom.</i>


00:02:02.549 --> 00:02:04.918
<i>And if you try to
resist her charms,</i>


00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:06.622
<i>you will not be forgiven.</i>


00:02:06.624 --> 00:02:08.927
<i>She will separate you
from the one you love.</i>


00:02:08.929 --> 00:02:13.803
<i>She will torture you until
your very last day on earth.</i>


00:02:13.805 --> 00:02:17.409
<i>You can only save
yourself if you give her</i>


00:02:17.411 --> 00:02:19.447
<i>your most precious thing.</i>


00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:25.729
<i>But the drowned woman has
never released anyone.</i>


00:02:27.499 --> 00:02:30.371
<i>Because they lost their
love, they perished.</i>


00:02:32.977 --> 00:02:36.818
<i>And now, you will
meet the same fate.</i>


00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:56.489
Misha.


00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:00.098
Stop this, please.


00:03:02.636 --> 00:03:05.040
Don't say a word, I beg you.


00:03:10.819 --> 00:03:11.886
Be silent.


00:03:11.888 --> 00:03:14.925
You hear me?
Be silent.


00:03:31.694 --> 00:03:33.062
Give him back, take me.


00:03:33.064 --> 00:03:35.168
Give him back, take me.


00:03:40.077 --> 00:03:41.614
Anya!


00:03:42.683 --> 00:03:46.223
Hurry!


00:03:51.734 --> 00:03:52.970
I'm sorry.


00:04:12.776 --> 00:04:14.177
She's here.


00:04:30.678 --> 00:04:32.847
Hand, give me your hand!


00:04:32.849 --> 00:04:34.251
Give me your hand!


00:05:05.416 --> 00:05:09.054
Knees together, point
your toes, that's good.


00:05:09.056 --> 00:05:11.125
Roma, tell
me about the house.


00:05:11.127 --> 00:05:12.160
Is it roomy?


00:05:12.162 --> 00:05:13.863
That's enough for today.


00:05:13.865 --> 00:05:15.132
Try not to be late tomorrow.


00:05:15.134 --> 00:05:17.438
When I was a kid,
it seemed kinda big.


00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:20.243
It's been 20 years
since I was last there.


00:05:20.245 --> 00:05:21.846
And it's for sale, anyway.


00:05:23.317 --> 00:05:24.885
So, we'll fix it up.


00:05:24.887 --> 00:05:26.755
Why, and do what with it?


00:05:26.757 --> 00:05:28.295
What do you mean?


00:05:29.195 --> 00:05:30.497
Live there.


00:05:33.104 --> 00:05:35.773
- All right, that's it.
- Hey!


00:05:35.775 --> 00:05:37.810
Come on now, try it, carefully.


00:05:37.812 --> 00:05:40.081
- No, no, no, no, no, no, no.
- Okay, now let go.


00:05:40.083 --> 00:05:43.189
- Let go, shh.
- No, no, Roma, it won't work!


00:05:43.191 --> 00:05:44.992
Come on, listen.


00:05:44.994 --> 00:05:47.265
Nothing works unless
you try it yourself.


00:05:48.868 --> 00:05:51.137
Trust the water,
it'll guide you.


00:05:51.139 --> 00:05:53.208
I don't want to trust it.


00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:54.913
Trust me then.


00:05:58.221 --> 00:06:01.961
Okay. Okay.


00:06:10.913 --> 00:06:12.482
Hold on, hold on.


00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:22.369
Swim away, dude.


00:06:24.172 --> 00:06:25.808
Hey, Marina, listen.


00:06:27.546 --> 00:06:29.484
I gotta borrow
your fiancé today.


00:06:30.385 --> 00:06:31.852
Why is that?


00:06:31.854 --> 00:06:34.157
I'm arranging a
little entertainment


00:06:34.159 --> 00:06:36.596
to celebrate the untimely
demise of his bachelorhood.


00:06:36.598 --> 00:06:39.200
Ah, you are aware
that such things


00:06:39.202 --> 00:06:42.340
often lead to the cancellation
of the wedding, right?


00:06:42.342 --> 00:06:44.144
Ah, don't you worry.


00:06:44.146 --> 00:06:45.815
I'll bring your boy home safe.


00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:50.323
I'll come back alone.


00:06:50.325 --> 00:06:52.227
We do have qualifications soon.


00:06:53.163 --> 00:06:54.432
You wimpin' out?


00:06:54.434 --> 00:06:56.437
Not me, you're the
one in trouble.


00:06:57.505 --> 00:06:58.973
You won't be able to swim.


00:06:58.975 --> 00:07:02.180
I won't, huh?


00:07:02.182 --> 00:07:05.252
Well, Kitaev, sounds
like a challenge.


00:07:07.693 --> 00:07:08.927
I mean it.


00:07:08.929 --> 00:07:10.596
Race me two laps.


00:07:10.598 --> 00:07:13.202
Let's see who won't
reach the line.


00:07:13.204 --> 00:07:15.206
You're gonna lose.


00:07:15.208 --> 00:07:17.413
Enough talk, come
over and prove it.


00:07:20.218 --> 00:07:21.986
Okay, I'll be right back.


00:07:21.988 --> 00:07:23.555
Let go of the side.


00:07:23.557 --> 00:07:27.531
Be proud of yourself.


00:07:40.292 --> 00:07:43.431
I'll just, just trust it.


00:07:45.702 --> 00:07:47.539
Trust the water.


00:08:33.297 --> 00:08:36.568
Don't cry, you'll
get me next time.


00:08:45.388 --> 00:08:46.823
Breathe, just breathe.


00:08:46.825 --> 00:08:47.825
Look at me, everything's fine.


00:08:47.827 --> 00:08:48.760
Just breathe.


00:08:48.762 --> 00:08:51.866
Breathe.


00:09:14.279 --> 00:09:15.348
What's for dinner?


00:09:16.417 --> 00:09:17.451
Faucet broke again.


00:09:17.453 --> 00:09:18.555
Fix it, please.


00:09:22.462 --> 00:09:24.566
Are you still mad
about the pool?


00:09:25.869 --> 00:09:27.671
It was fine.
I got there in time.


00:09:27.673 --> 00:09:29.508
Roma, I can't swim.


00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:31.213
You promised to be around.


00:09:32.482 --> 00:09:34.684
I left you at the edge, right?


00:09:34.686 --> 00:09:35.823
What happened?


00:09:38.762 --> 00:09:39.995
So is she pissed at you?


00:09:39.997 --> 00:09:41.932
Yeah, it looks like it.


00:09:41.934 --> 00:09:43.337
Ah, whatever.


00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:46.910
She just freaked out a bit.


00:09:46.912 --> 00:09:48.380
She'll get over it.


00:09:50.351 --> 00:09:51.752
I shoulda stayed.


00:09:51.754 --> 00:09:53.456
Come on.


00:09:53.458 --> 00:09:55.460
The hell's that mean?


00:09:55.462 --> 00:09:57.363
We're already gone, so what?


00:09:57.365 --> 00:09:59.300
We'll see the house, chill out


00:09:59.302 --> 00:10:02.408
for a while, enjoy
some fresh air.


00:10:06.049 --> 00:10:07.784
Take it easy.


00:10:07.786 --> 00:10:09.788
I mean, it's normal to freak
out before the wedding.


00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.793
You worry, so does he.


00:10:11.795 --> 00:10:14.031
Where is he, by the way?


00:10:14.033 --> 00:10:16.402
- Who?
- Roma, silly.


00:10:16.404 --> 00:10:20.577
Probably
at the summer house.


00:10:20.579 --> 00:10:22.646
What summer house?


00:10:22.648 --> 00:10:25.553
Mm, the old one
your father gave us,


00:10:25.555 --> 00:10:28.493
you know, as a wedding gift.


00:10:28.495 --> 00:10:30.497
Wait, our father has shown up?


00:10:30.499 --> 00:10:31.799
Olga, don't move.


00:10:31.801 --> 00:10:33.535
I don't know.


00:10:33.537 --> 00:10:38.780
He sent the deed, the keys,
told us to sell it off.


00:10:38.782 --> 00:10:40.652
I would rather fix
it up, to be honest.


00:10:41.621 --> 00:10:42.656
Strange.


00:10:44.026 --> 00:10:45.526
What's strange?


00:10:45.528 --> 00:10:48.534
We haven't seen
him for 20 years.


00:11:09.442 --> 00:11:10.945
Wow, it's still a dump.


00:11:10.947 --> 00:11:13.450
I thought he sold it ages ago.


00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:16.989
What's wrong with him?


00:11:16.991 --> 00:11:18.860
Your father, I mean.


00:11:18.862 --> 00:11:20.630
Did you see the
lake around there?


00:11:20.632 --> 00:11:21.701
Yeah.


00:11:24.472 --> 00:11:25.943
It's where my mother drowned.


00:11:28.481 --> 00:11:31.552
Father went nuts because
of it, but I was a kid.


00:11:31.554 --> 00:11:32.787
I don't remember.


00:11:32.789 --> 00:11:34.893
I see.


00:11:34.895 --> 00:11:37.631
Olga and I were
at our grandparents'.


00:11:37.633 --> 00:11:38.966
I haven't seen him since.


00:11:38.968 --> 00:11:40.705
Damn, that sounds bad.


00:11:41.841 --> 00:11:44.645
Have you tried talking to him?


00:11:44.647 --> 00:11:46.783
- Who, my dad?
- Yeah.


00:11:46.785 --> 00:11:49.523
Give me some light.


00:11:51.928 --> 00:11:54.032
I don't even know him.
What can he tell me?


00:11:57.205 --> 00:11:58.807
About your mom, maybe.


00:12:29.837 --> 00:12:33.075
Kit, we have electricity
in this place?


00:12:33.077 --> 00:12:34.781
Check for a fuse box.


00:12:37.652 --> 00:12:39.089
A fuse box, he says.


00:13:10.318 --> 00:13:11.822
Ilya?


00:13:44.454 --> 00:13:46.990
Yeah, what you doing down here?


00:13:46.992 --> 00:13:48.194
Put the light down.


00:13:53.804 --> 00:13:54.873
Whoa!


00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:01.785
There must have been a flood.


00:14:01.787 --> 00:14:03.822
Need to clean the drain.


00:14:06.997 --> 00:14:08.500
- Yo!
- Hey, hey!


00:14:08.502 --> 00:14:10.205
- I think we're here, guys.
- Is this the place, man?


00:14:11.808 --> 00:14:13.509
This place
looks haunted as shit.


00:14:13.511 --> 00:14:15.179
- Come on, hurry up!
- What the hell is this, Ilya?


00:14:15.181 --> 00:14:15.880
What do you think?


00:14:15.882 --> 00:14:17.218
I told you we need to chill out.


00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:18.253
Come on, it's fine.


00:14:18.255 --> 00:14:20.356
- Yeah, yeah, come on in.
- I'm not in the mood.


00:14:20.358 --> 00:14:21.391
I know you're not.


00:14:21.393 --> 00:14:23.765
I'm fixing your mood.


00:14:25.201 --> 00:14:27.538
We used to tell fortunes
with my mom for fun.


00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:30.510
We'd look into two mirrors
opposite each other


00:14:30.512 --> 00:14:32.581
and see if we can
spot Mr. Right.


00:14:32.583 --> 00:14:34.017
Well, did you see him?


00:14:34.019 --> 00:14:35.353
Course not,
it's nonsense.


00:14:35.355 --> 00:14:37.524
What, burning your hair is not?


00:14:37.526 --> 00:14:39.495
I don't believe in
the Mr. Right thing,


00:14:39.497 --> 00:14:42.099
I do believe in
the power of hair,


00:14:42.101 --> 00:14:46.542
and one shouldn't leave
it behind, even here.


00:14:46.544 --> 00:14:48.045
Don't worry about Roma.


00:14:48.047 --> 00:14:49.214
You're a great couple.


00:14:49.216 --> 00:14:51.351
No need to fight, okay?


00:14:51.353 --> 00:14:52.523
Okay, bye.


00:15:38.047 --> 00:15:40.249
All right!


00:15:40.251 --> 00:15:42.456
Hey, guys, to the groom.


00:15:43.725 --> 00:15:45.627
Marina's a nice girl, of course.


00:15:45.629 --> 00:15:48.499
No, really, I mean it, but
this is a life sentence.


00:15:48.501 --> 00:15:50.436
Yeah.


00:15:50.438 --> 00:15:52.441
So, buddy, to
spend the last days


00:15:52.443 --> 00:15:54.009
of your bachelor
life to the fullest,


00:15:55.315 --> 00:16:00.289
from us to you,
we got you a present.


00:16:00.291 --> 00:16:01.726
Let's get this party started!


00:16:01.728 --> 00:16:04.097
Yeah, yeah, bring 'em in!


00:16:08.408 --> 00:16:09.742
Oh, ho, ho!


00:16:22.636 --> 00:16:24.137
Guys, thank you.


00:16:24.139 --> 00:16:26.408
No offense, okay,
you all have fun.


00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:28.278
I gotta take a walk.


00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:29.315
Ah, what?


00:16:29.317 --> 00:16:30.550
He's acting weird.


00:16:30.552 --> 00:16:33.090
- What happened?
- Come on, man.


00:19:59.503 --> 00:20:01.909
Do you love me?


00:20:37.612 --> 00:20:38.747
Roma!


00:20:38.749 --> 00:20:41.319
- Roma!
- Roma!


00:20:41.321 --> 00:20:42.821
- Kitaev!
- Roma!


00:20:42.823 --> 00:20:43.856
Kit, Kit!


00:20:43.858 --> 00:20:45.930
- Where you at?
- Roma!


00:20:47.032 --> 00:20:49.738
Kit, where are you?


00:20:50.973 --> 00:20:53.042
Kitaev!


00:20:53.044 --> 00:20:54.978
Roma, where are you?


00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.184
Kitaev!


00:20:59.023 --> 00:21:02.260
Rome, what are you
doing on the ground?


00:21:02.262 --> 00:21:04.298
Roma, what are
you doing on the ground?


00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:06.236
Guys, give me a hand.


00:21:06.238 --> 00:21:07.804
- Where's the girl?
- What girl?


00:21:07.806 --> 00:21:09.107
- All right, let's go.
- There was a girl here.


00:21:09.109 --> 00:21:10.811
Where is she?


00:21:10.813 --> 00:21:13.349
What friggin' girl?


00:21:40.205 --> 00:21:43.376
Been there for long?


00:21:43.378 --> 00:21:45.848
Long enough
to see these bloom.


00:22:33.478 --> 00:22:35.916
Your arms, Kitaev, your arms!


00:22:37.285 --> 00:22:40.859
Ulyanov, speed up,
longer oars, longer!


00:22:42.196 --> 00:22:44.565
Rodionov, how many
times do I need to say,


00:22:44.567 --> 00:22:47.337
keep your elbows underwater?


00:22:47.339 --> 00:22:48.974
What's going on, huh?


00:22:48.976 --> 00:22:50.276
Qualification's tomorrow.


00:22:50.278 --> 00:22:54.252
Rome, don't piss
away our hard work.


00:22:54.254 --> 00:22:56.088
Did something happen, Rome?


00:22:56.090 --> 00:22:58.192
Feel sick, got a fever, what?


00:22:58.194 --> 00:22:59.227
Didn't sleep well.


00:22:59.229 --> 00:23:02.233
Didn't sleep well.


00:23:02.235 --> 00:23:04.872
I'll be fine by tomorrow, coach.


00:23:04.874 --> 00:23:07.944
Uh-huh, first position.


00:23:07.946 --> 00:23:10.386
Keep swimming 'til
you get it right.


00:23:12.289 --> 00:23:15.861
Coach Nikolayevich, Marina and I


00:23:15.863 --> 00:23:19.034
were planning on
having dinner together.


00:23:19.036 --> 00:23:20.872
You could do that.


00:23:21.574 --> 00:23:22.574
Up to you.


00:23:42.249 --> 00:23:43.616
Are you feeling all right?


00:23:43.618 --> 00:23:45.420
I'm fine.


00:23:45.422 --> 00:23:47.458
Doesn't look like it.


00:23:47.460 --> 00:23:48.460
Everything's fine.


00:23:48.462 --> 00:23:49.565
You sure?


00:23:50.331 --> 00:23:51.501
Yeah, man.


00:25:49.938 --> 00:25:52.543
Do you love me?


00:26:39.671 --> 00:26:41.507
Marina, stop it.


00:26:45.883 --> 00:26:47.584
I'm not feeling very well.


00:26:49.725 --> 00:26:50.891
Enough already!


00:27:03.418 --> 00:27:07.023
I'll sue your damn
coach into the ground.


00:27:07.025 --> 00:27:11.702
He shouldn't have let you
swim when you're this sick.


00:27:13.037 --> 00:27:14.641
Here, drink it.


00:27:20.619 --> 00:27:22.487
Lie down.


00:27:22.489 --> 00:27:24.795
Come on, lie down, lie down.


00:27:30.806 --> 00:27:32.643
You're burning up.


00:27:37.052 --> 00:27:38.823
I don't love you.


00:27:39.724 --> 00:27:41.394
I don't love you.


00:27:42.462 --> 00:27:43.763
<i>How is he feeling?</i>


00:27:43.765 --> 00:27:47.470
Looks better, I guess, asleep.


00:27:47.472 --> 00:27:48.642
<i>Good.</i>


00:27:49.878 --> 00:27:54.117
<i>I was wondering, though,</i>


00:27:54.119 --> 00:27:56.488
<i>why do you need to
fix the place up?</i>


00:27:56.490 --> 00:27:58.059
<i>I mean, you can find
an agent and sell it.</i>


00:27:58.061 --> 00:27:59.929
<i>Easier for everyone,
don't you think?</i>


00:27:59.931 --> 00:28:03.436
I don't know. I'd have to
discuss it with Roma first.


00:28:03.438 --> 00:28:05.709
<i>Had another fight?</i>


00:28:06.577 --> 00:28:07.679
No, no.


00:28:09.783 --> 00:28:15.528
Just, um, he's acting strange.


00:28:17.032 --> 00:28:19.468
Maybe he met someone.


00:28:19.470 --> 00:28:20.570
<i>No way.</i>


00:28:20.572 --> 00:28:22.476
I found something.


00:28:28.488 --> 00:28:29.688
- Look.
- <i>Looks like junk.</i>


00:28:29.690 --> 00:28:31.128
<i>Hold it closer.</i>


00:28:33.065 --> 00:28:34.564
<i>Did you ask where it came from?</i>


00:28:34.566 --> 00:28:36.035
Mm-mm.


00:28:36.037 --> 00:28:37.237
<i>See, you're
winding yourself up.</i>


00:28:37.239 --> 00:28:38.239
<i>Go get some rest.</i>


00:28:38.241 --> 00:28:39.876
<i>It'll be okay.</i>


00:28:39.878 --> 00:28:41.078
Thanks, Olga.


00:28:41.080 --> 00:28:42.514
<i>Bye.</i>


00:28:42.516 --> 00:28:44.887
See ya.


00:29:57.666 --> 00:29:58.836
Rome?


00:31:05.869 --> 00:31:07.907
Quiet, be quiet.


00:31:09.444 --> 00:31:13.350
Just a dream,
it was just a bad dream.


00:31:13.352 --> 00:31:14.854
Shh.


00:31:23.238 --> 00:31:24.606
He's got a nice speed.


00:31:24.608 --> 00:31:25.941
It's impressive.


00:31:25.943 --> 00:31:27.512
<i>This race is over.</i>


00:31:27.514 --> 00:31:33.857
<i>Attention, please, Kitaev,
Rodionov, get ready.</i>


00:31:33.859 --> 00:31:35.494
Okay, guys, keep your speed.


00:31:35.496 --> 00:31:36.562
Remember the technique.


00:31:36.564 --> 00:31:38.601
Ilya, elbows.


00:31:38.603 --> 00:31:40.906
Roma, like yesterday.


00:31:43.612 --> 00:31:45.883
Now, go on, good luck.


00:31:50.392 --> 00:31:53.631
- Pass me a water.
- Yeah, sure, which one?


00:31:53.633 --> 00:31:55.502
Thank you.


00:33:38.308 --> 00:33:41.381
Do you love me?


00:33:44.754 --> 00:33:47.092
No, no, no.


00:33:57.179 --> 00:33:59.481
Help, need
some help over here.


00:33:59.483 --> 00:34:00.785
Hey, what happened?


00:34:00.787 --> 00:34:02.387
What's wrong, is he all right?


00:34:02.389 --> 00:34:05.192
Just breathe,
okay, just breathe.


00:34:05.194 --> 00:34:07.197
We got you, come on.


00:34:07.199 --> 00:34:09.234
Wake up. It's gonna be all
right, just hang on.


00:34:09.236 --> 00:34:11.873
- Come on, all right?
- Breathe.


00:34:13.311 --> 00:34:18.488
There was a young girl,
barely a teenager.


00:34:21.728 --> 00:34:24.365
I can't shake the
feeling she's around.


00:34:24.367 --> 00:34:29.645
Every time I close my
eyes, I see her face.


00:34:31.782 --> 00:34:33.685
What face?


00:34:35.757 --> 00:34:38.160
She's like a wild animal.


00:34:43.505 --> 00:34:47.346
Roma, the doctor says
you got dehydrated.


00:34:50.987 --> 00:34:54.591
You just need to sleep it off.


00:34:54.593 --> 00:34:56.729
You're tired.


00:34:56.731 --> 00:34:58.969
No, that's not the point.


00:35:02.844 --> 00:35:04.913
Tell us more, Roma.


00:35:04.915 --> 00:35:07.519
Where did you first see her?


00:35:14.634 --> 00:35:15.970
On the lake.


00:35:18.876 --> 00:35:21.247
She was wearing my shirt.


00:35:22.549 --> 00:35:24.886
I was drawn to her.


00:35:24.888 --> 00:35:26.023
He's delirious.


00:35:27.092 --> 00:35:28.894
There was nobody there.


00:35:28.896 --> 00:35:32.068
I swear I couldn't help myself.


00:35:32.070 --> 00:35:36.277
We kissed, and I felt
like I couldn't breathe.


00:35:37.781 --> 00:35:39.816
- Rome.
- Marina, I'm sorry.


00:35:39.818 --> 00:35:40.985
I just couldn't help myself.


00:35:40.987 --> 00:35:41.987
Please, Marina!


00:35:50.105 --> 00:35:51.673
Roma, listen to me.


00:35:51.675 --> 00:35:52.875
What else do you remember?


00:35:52.877 --> 00:35:55.848
- What did she look like?
- Okay, hold on.


00:35:55.850 --> 00:35:58.055
Roma, come back!


00:36:02.062 --> 00:36:03.064
Marina.


00:36:08.675 --> 00:36:11.581
Marina, Marina!


00:36:12.750 --> 00:36:17.727
<i>He doesn't need you.</i>


00:36:42.243 --> 00:36:43.578
Marina?


00:37:17.847 --> 00:37:19.049
Marina.


00:37:22.290 --> 00:37:25.763
Roma, what's wrong?


00:37:33.345 --> 00:37:35.282
Rome!


00:37:39.223 --> 00:37:42.196
Somebody, please,
we need some help!


00:37:46.604 --> 00:37:47.705
Hurry!


00:37:50.078 --> 00:37:51.180
Roma!


00:37:53.184 --> 00:37:56.022
Kit, Kit, open up!


00:37:56.024 --> 00:37:57.592
Roma!


00:38:31.962 --> 00:38:33.729
He doesn't look good.


00:38:33.731 --> 00:38:34.832
He's on death's door.


00:38:34.834 --> 00:38:36.972
Should we take him back?


00:38:40.245 --> 00:38:43.719
We have to go and meet
with someone first.


00:38:53.204 --> 00:38:55.140
Hello, Dad.


00:38:59.083 --> 00:39:00.851
You gave Roma the house.


00:39:00.853 --> 00:39:02.922
Why?


00:39:02.924 --> 00:39:04.493
You shouldn't
have come here.


00:39:04.495 --> 00:39:06.229
I'm sick.


00:39:06.231 --> 00:39:07.999
Roma saw the girl on the lake.


00:39:14.180 --> 00:39:16.016
With the long hair.


00:39:18.789 --> 00:39:22.998
She took his shirt,
and now he's ill.


00:39:29.545 --> 00:39:33.953
That's impossible.
She died a long time ago.


00:39:36.191 --> 00:39:39.129
Do you recognize this?


00:39:44.274 --> 00:39:45.340
No, I don't.


00:39:45.342 --> 00:39:47.044
Now, leave.


00:39:49.917 --> 00:39:53.624
Father, what exactly
happened 20 years ago?


00:39:53.626 --> 00:39:55.260
- Olga.
- Speak up now!


00:39:55.262 --> 00:39:57.131
- Olga!
- How did Mom die?


00:39:57.133 --> 00:39:58.901
- Olga, that's enough!
- Your son may be next.


00:39:58.903 --> 00:40:00.170
Leave me be!


00:40:00.172 --> 00:40:01.306
I'm begging you, please!


00:40:01.308 --> 00:40:02.609
- Tell us!
- Stop it, get out!


00:40:02.611 --> 00:40:04.210
You can't
hide your whole life.


00:40:04.212 --> 00:40:06.550
She drowned, all right!


00:40:06.552 --> 00:40:07.920
She drowned!


00:40:12.229 --> 00:40:13.432
Dad.


00:40:22.984 --> 00:40:27.291
You... don't talk to her.


00:40:27.293 --> 00:40:30.163
- Don't you dare talk to her!
- Who?


00:40:30.165 --> 00:40:33.169
She'll take you away!


00:40:33.171 --> 00:40:37.581
Don't you, don't
you dare!


00:40:44.327 --> 00:40:46.562
<i>I met her on the lake.</i>


00:40:46.564 --> 00:40:48.634
<i>She asked if I loved her.</i>


00:40:48.636 --> 00:40:52.609
<i>I didn't answer,
so she kept coming back,</i>


00:40:52.611 --> 00:40:55.382
torturing me the entire time.


00:40:56.484 --> 00:41:00.390
I couldn't escape from her.


00:41:00.392 --> 00:41:05.302
Your mother, she somehow
found a way to get rid of her.


00:41:08.408 --> 00:41:12.649
<i>I called her by her name,
but it didn't work,</i>


00:41:12.651 --> 00:41:14.385
and she took your mother away.


00:41:17.461 --> 00:41:18.727
She never came back.


00:41:20.499 --> 00:41:25.710
From that day, everything lost
its meaning, everything but her.


00:41:27.279 --> 00:41:30.117
I think about her
every single day.


00:41:31.789 --> 00:41:37.166
Not your mom, but her.


00:41:39.237 --> 00:41:44.646
I see her hair, her eyes.


00:41:44.648 --> 00:41:46.616
I can never forget her.


00:41:48.088 --> 00:41:50.793
What did Mom
do specifically?


00:41:58.241 --> 00:42:00.277
Not sure.


00:42:00.279 --> 00:42:05.356
Under the old dock, she found
something under the water.


00:42:14.240 --> 00:42:17.211
Except it won't
help you, my son.


00:42:19.250 --> 00:42:20.820
She will drive you mad.


00:42:23.358 --> 00:42:25.293
Let's go
to this damn lake.


00:42:25.295 --> 00:42:27.197
We need to know what
your mother did.


00:42:58.797 --> 00:43:00.867
Sit, sit, sit.


00:43:04.441 --> 00:43:05.843
Everything okay?


00:43:16.832 --> 00:43:21.340
It's been 20 years,
but nothing here has changed.


00:43:36.772 --> 00:43:39.709
Marina, you're not
mad at Kitaev, are you?


00:43:39.711 --> 00:43:41.480
He was out of his mind,
you know.


00:43:41.482 --> 00:43:43.450
None of your business,
get in the water.


00:43:43.452 --> 00:43:45.054
Everything'll be fine.


00:43:45.056 --> 00:43:47.491
Stay with Roma, please.


00:43:47.493 --> 00:43:48.660
Hey, swimmer boy, come with me.


00:43:48.662 --> 00:43:50.430
So, what, are you in charge now?


00:43:50.432 --> 00:43:52.337
Come on, we can't
do it without you.


00:43:55.375 --> 00:43:56.812
Don't be scared.


00:44:13.045 --> 00:44:14.915
Please forgive me.


00:44:19.157 --> 00:44:21.360
We can deal with this.


00:44:23.498 --> 00:44:25.870
We'll sort it out together.


00:44:36.792 --> 00:44:40.132
Let me
get you some water.


00:44:53.057 --> 00:44:56.196
Right here's where I found
him, with the comb next to him.


00:44:56.198 --> 00:44:57.700
Mm-hmm.


00:45:04.781 --> 00:45:07.654
Take your clothes off.
You need to dive in.


00:45:13.198 --> 00:45:14.265
Shit.


00:46:18.396 --> 00:46:20.097
Got it!


00:47:41.429 --> 00:47:42.495
Ilya!


00:47:45.503 --> 00:47:46.973
Ilya!


00:47:51.014 --> 00:47:52.216
Ilya!


00:48:19.571 --> 00:48:22.408
Lisa.


00:48:22.410 --> 00:48:26.583
Lisa Grigorieva's
her name.


00:49:10.372 --> 00:49:12.207
<i>Take what's yours.</i>


00:49:12.209 --> 00:49:13.510
<i>Give me the loved one.</i>


00:49:20.427 --> 00:49:22.027
<i>Take what's yours.</i>


00:49:22.029 --> 00:49:23.666
<i>Give me the loved one.</i>


00:49:26.037 --> 00:49:28.641
<i>Take what's yours.</i>


00:49:28.643 --> 00:49:31.447
<i>Give me the loved one.</i>


00:49:31.449 --> 00:49:32.682
<i>Take what's yours.</i>


00:49:32.684 --> 00:49:34.686
<i>Give me the loved one.</i>


00:49:34.688 --> 00:49:36.022
Take.


