Roma!


00:50:23.118 --> 00:50:24.153
Rome.


00:50:28.429 --> 00:50:29.665
Roma.


00:50:37.882 --> 00:50:39.116
Rome.


00:50:47.802 --> 00:50:49.170
I saw her.


00:50:51.475 --> 00:50:52.644
Who?


00:50:55.783 --> 00:50:57.186
Your mother.


00:51:07.774 --> 00:51:08.774
Rome!


00:51:11.314 --> 00:51:12.280
Roma!


00:51:57.841 --> 00:51:59.810
Drink this.


00:51:59.812 --> 00:52:01.582
