00:52:06.325 --> 00:52:10.564
Maybe it's all about the comb.


00:52:10.566 --> 00:52:14.739
LG, Lisa Grigorieva.


00:52:17.080 --> 00:52:19.949
Lisa.


00:52:19.951 --> 00:52:21.021
Suicide.


00:52:22.657 --> 00:52:25.062
What makes you think
she committed suicide?


00:52:26.665 --> 00:52:29.602
Suicide victims weren't
buried in cemeteries.


00:52:29.604 --> 00:52:32.041
So, what, they buried
her in the lake?


00:52:32.043 --> 00:52:33.945
On the shore.


00:52:33.947 --> 00:52:37.953
The lake spilled over
when the dam was built.


00:52:37.955 --> 00:52:41.927
Well, what should we do?


00:52:41.929 --> 00:52:44.568
This has to be it.


00:52:45.904 --> 00:52:47.940
