00:52:59.765 --> 00:53:03.604
Your mom was performing
a ritual in the bath.


00:53:03.606 --> 00:53:05.808
What do you think?


00:53:05.810 --> 00:53:07.879
Ritual?


00:53:07.881 --> 00:53:10.787
