00:53:15.931 --> 00:53:18.667
No, she'll find him anywhere.


00:53:18.669 --> 00:53:20.072
We need to fight.


00:53:28.822 --> 00:53:30.193
What is it, Rome?


00:53:31.995 --> 00:53:34.034
