- I'm fine.


01:04:03.426 --> 01:04:05.196
Get in, we're leaving.


01:04:22.130 --> 01:04:23.199
Ready?


01:04:29.210 --> 01:04:31.882
Your mother was beautiful.


01:04:34.355 --> 01:04:36.359
Let's get out of here.


01:04:56.265 --> 01:04:59.236
