01:12:28.437 --> 01:12:30.240
She can't be killed, see?


01:12:31.108 --> 01:12:32.311
She can't.


01:12:33.413 --> 01:12:35.150
It's a life for a life.


01:12:37.120 --> 01:12:42.364
Mom gave hers for Dad,
so you give yours for Roma.


01:12:44.000 --> 01:12:45.301
