untie me.


01:12:51.047 --> 01:12:53.149
- Olga, Olga.
- Lisa Grigorieva.


01:12:53.151 --> 01:12:55.188
- Take the bride.
- Please, I'm begging you.


01:12:55.190 --> 01:12:57.092
Give my brother back.


01:13:09.151 --> 01:13:11.553
Olga, Olga, please, untie me.


01:13:12.591 --> 01:13:14.326
I'm begging you, don't do this!


01:13:14.328 --> 01:13:17.231
Lisa Grigorieva,
take the bride!


01:13:17.233 --> 01:13:18.504
Give my brother back.


01:13:20.073 --> 01:13:22.609
Let me out of here!


01:13:22.611 --> 01:13:24.479
You have to!


01:13:26.553 --> 01:13:29.526
Lisa Grigorieva, take the bride.


01:13:33.934 --> 01:13:35.036
Olga!


01:13:40.012 --> 01:13:41.315
This will not work.


01:13:43.687 --> 01:13:45.557
Your mother
volunteered her life.


01:13:47.160 --> 01:13:48.194
It can't be forced.


01:13:48.196 --> 01:13:50.200
Get the hell back!


01:13:58.683 --> 01:14:01.355
We can only feed
her with our love.


01:14:03.158 --> 01:14:05.930
And then she turns
it into hatred.


01:14:10.440 --> 01:14:11.675
Agony.


01:14:14.982 --> 01:14:17.052
She wants us to suffer.


01:14:22.063 --> 01:14:23.166
I was weak.


01:14:24.301 --> 01:14:25.403
You are strong.


01:14:27.340 --> 01:14:29.446
You're stronger than
any of us, dear.


01:14:32.083 --> 01:14:35.457
You have your mother's
eyes, same eyes.


01:14:37.494 --> 01:14:39.464
I won't leave Roma.


01:14:39.466 --> 01:14:41.336
I won't leave him.


01:14:43.674 --> 01:14:45.510
You don't have to.


01:15:01.242 --> 01:15:03.447
We'll find a way out, dear.


01:15:04.616 --> 01:15:06.283
Forgive me.


01:15:06.285 --> 01:15:07.354
Forgive me.


01:15:08.289 --> 01:15:09.322
Forgive me.


01:15:15.404 --> 01:15:16.673
Dad.


01:15:17.742 --> 01:15:18.810
Dad!


01:15:38.483 --> 01:15:41.588
I haven't seen you for so long.


01:15:41.590 --> 01:15:43.092
Take me.


01:15:44.929 --> 01:15:46.498
Leave them alone.


01:15:50.808 --> 01:15:52.176
No, Dad.


01:15:55.283 --> 01:15:56.820
I still love you.


01:16:12.652 --> 01:16:17.626
Dad!


01:16:52.364 --> 01:16:53.734
Dad, Dad, please!


01:17:13.506 --> 01:17:15.075
Rome, Roma!


01:17:33.546 --> 01:17:36.416
We were wrong.


01:17:36.418 --> 01:17:37.518
It's not about the comb.


01:17:38.523 --> 01:17:41.494
Rome, her power is in her hair.


01:17:41.496 --> 01:17:43.030
You need to cut it off,
do you hear me?


01:17:43.032 --> 01:17:44.502
Just cut off her hair!


01:17:46.505 --> 01:17:47.640
Rome, Rome!


01:17:53.954 --> 01:17:55.624
Rome, Rome, Rome!


01:18:05.811 --> 01:18:07.713
<i>A life for a life.</i>


01:18:07.715 --> 01:18:08.985
<i>Mom gave hers for Dad.</i>


01:18:18.002 --> 01:18:19.737
Give him back.


01:18:19.739 --> 01:18:22.541
Take me.


01:19:49.785 --> 01:19:51.355
Do you love me?


01:20:14.468 --> 01:20:15.837
Of course.


01:21:36.565 --> 01:21:39.439
Hey!


01:21:41.443 --> 01:21:42.976
Wake up.


01:21:42.978 --> 01:21:44.913
Wake up!


01:21:44.915 --> 01:21:48.924
No!


01:21:53.567 --> 01:21:55.569
Please, I made it!


01:21:55.571 --> 01:21:57.973
Please, I made it in time!


01:21:57.975 --> 01:21:59.144
Wake up!


01:22:03.620 --> 01:22:06.055
Please, I made it in time!


01:22:06.057 --> 01:22:10.467
Breathe!


01:23:29.794 --> 01:23:34.794
Subtitles by explosiveskull

